    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Fate of Stars, a PvP auto-battler collectible game with unique inventory management mechanics! Collect heroes, craft powerful items, and battle other players in strategic duels!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849220/extras/1ef34d9bf2b5e0b80867027f2b3ca34e.webp?t=1730451906\" /></div><br><br>Normal - choose your hero, get 2 random pets and  battle other players <br>Arena - choose one of 3 random heroes, get 2 random pets,  add challenge tokens  and   battle other players  for the best reward<br>Tournament - regular automated tournaments for rewards and glory<br>1 VS 1 - play with your friends in 1 vs 1 battles<br>Adventure  - short stories with PvE battles<br>Challenges - PvE boss battles <br><br>Normal and Arena modes will be available at the beginning of Early Access.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect heroes</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849220/extras/af6c95a64a3e5b59b460875f5d520d3c.avif?t=1730451906\" /></div><br><br>Choose a hero to battle other players. In the early access, 2 heroes and 10 pets will be available. In the full version of the game, we plan to add more than 20 heroes and 30 pets. Unlock new heroes and pets by winning battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Collect &amp; Craft Powerful Items</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849220/extras/a842728c0da944c2f335297687b5c46f.avif?t=1730451906\" /></div><br><br>Buy and create powerful items in the forge, assemble unique builds from them and win! Your victory depends on what items you get and how you place them. More than 100 basic items and more than 20 crafted ones are available in the early access version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle other Players</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/849220/extras/5054604c3b34e7fb8a9f0b2ce674fd68.avif?t=1730451906\" /></div><br><br>Fight other players in different modes, come up with new builds or study your opponents' builds. As a reward, you will receive loot and a place in the ranking!",
